21
00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:15.298
So that means the face, the bone, the skin, up to the level of flattening, is

22
00:01:15.298 --> 00:01:16.578
actually from the neural crest.

23
00:01:16.858 --> 00:01:21.058
It is a tissue that is highly informed and informative.

24
00:01:21.618 --> 00:01:24.078
Everything inside you is from the neural crest.

25
00:01:24.207 --> 00:01:26.207
If all these ganglia, all these little things,

26
00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:30.007
well, they show you on the face what is happening inside you.

27
00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:34.607
So, you can learn to read the face, wrinkles, dark circles, colors.

28
00:01:35.087 --> 00:01:37.007
First, I have this prosencephalon.

29
00:01:37.107 --> 00:01:42.747
This prosencephalon will become telencephalon and diencephalon.

30
00:01:43.187 --> 00:01:46.887
And so, you have a whole migration of the diencephalon.

31
00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:52.067
So you have the diencephalon and the anterior mesencephalon that will migrate.

32
00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:53.876
at the level of the neural crest.

33
00:01:54.016 --> 00:01:57.976
So this means it’s a flow that happens like this and like this.

34
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:02.276
But before the closing of the neural tube occurs,

35
00:02:02.356 --> 00:02:06.856
there was also a negative factor, as I explained this morning.

36
00:02:07.896 --> 00:02:12.356
So it provided information regarding the hepatopancreatic,

37
00:02:12.516 --> 00:02:14.156
thyroid, and cardiac systems.

38
00:02:14.436 --> 00:02:17.116
So all of this will inform the neural crest,

39
00:02:17.276 --> 00:02:20.216
