40
00:02:20.345 --> 00:02:24.965
So it’s mesoderm with neural crest.

41
00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:30.605
And we see here the importance of this migration, this colonization of

42
00:02:30.605 --> 00:02:31.485
the neural crest

43
00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:34.485
which will inform, which will give a specific quality.

44
00:02:34.805 --> 00:02:39.865
But it will also have an impact on the construction of micro-vessels and micro

45
00:02:39.865 --> 00:02:41.165
nerves especially.

46
00:02:41.745 --> 00:02:46.065
And especially on the micro-nerves it will influence and also on the pericytes.

47
00:02:46.305 --> 00:02:48.345
So it will inform, it will reconstruct.

48
00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:53.094
Build support points, emergence points, endpoints.

49
00:02:53.994 --> 00:02:59.374
Up to giving this embryonic force to restructure as much as possible

50
00:02:59.374 --> 00:03:02.214
these processes, these micro-nerves that regrow.

51
00:03:02.794 --> 00:03:04.614
But to help them, gradually.

52
00:03:05.414 --> 00:03:08.354
And don’t forget, it’s at an electrical level.

53
00:03:09.094 --> 00:03:14.174
And at the level of the eye, you see, it will have all the glassy side, you see, which will completely

54
00:03:14.174 --> 00:03:14.754
encompass.

55
00:03:14.754 --> 00:03:16.414
And give...

56
00:03:16.483 --> 00:03:18.383
all this tissue here in front

57
00:03:18.383 --> 00:03:20.683
which will be ectoderm,

58
00:03:21.163 --> 00:03:22.243
among other things related

59
00:03:22.243 --> 00:03:23.503
to this flow

